；所誉依已成，所毁依已败。此吾所以叹息也","attribution":"裴注·《会稽典录》","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":122,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2e06f133cf78fd78cb18","start":75,"end":141,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-adca67f5606638bdbe9d","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-83dec35c399f832d797d","layer":"pei","quote":"交同县王岐于孤宦之族，仕进先至宜都太守；忠乃代之","attribution":"裴注·《会稽典录》","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-122f7f0974a37fbc5812","start":66,"end":90,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-e7ebdc907f127d86d269","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-83dec35c399f832d797d","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《会稽典录》曰：“忠，字世方。翻第五子。贞固干事，好识人物；造吴郡陆机于童龀之年，称上虞魏迁于无名之初：终皆远致，为著闻之士。交同县王岐于孤宦之族，仕进先至宜都太守；忠乃代之。晋征吴，忠与夷道监陆晏、晏弟中夏督景，坚守不下，城溃被害。忠子谭，字思奥。”","attribution":"裴注·会稽典录","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-122f7f0974a37fbc5812","start":0,"end":129,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
